cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Diophantine-ZQ-improved: Lean 4 lemmas and a Q-witness count for a Stage 1 variant of Glazer's definition of Z in Q"
abstract: >-
  Machine-checked component lemmas (Lucas's theorem for mask, carry-free register
  decoding, single-slot zero test) and an exact count showing that a Stage 1
  variant of the natural circuit behind Elliot Glazer's definition of Z in Q has
  157,023,255,238 rational witnesses instead of 292,890,231,904. Multi-slot
  correctness of the Stage 1 variant is not proved.
authors:
  - name: "yoonwoojeong"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/yoonwoojeong/Diophantine-ZQ-improved"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
keywords:
  - Hilbert's tenth problem
  - Diophantine definition
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
references:
  - type: software
    title: "Z is Diophantine in Q"
    authors:
      - family-names: Glazer
        given-names: Elliot
    repository-code: "https://github.com/elliotglazer/diophantine-z-q"
